WEBVTT

1
00:00:06,860 --> 00:00:10,230
Chen Zhenghao is a ruthless person

2
00:00:11,240 --> 00:00:13,320
The stars have completely exterminated humanity

3
00:00:14,980 --> 00:00:15,940
Things are tough now

4
00:00:16,180 --> 00:00:17,220
Everyone is trying to survive

5
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:18,980
I don't want to hurt anyone casually

6
00:00:19,220 --> 00:00:21,340
301 Uchido was the one who first seduced me.

7
00:00:21,580 --> 00:00:22,780
I just struck back and hurt him.

8
00:00:23,140 --> 00:00:24,260
I'm not a devil at all

9
00:00:24,540 --> 00:00:26,180
Let’s all get along well in the future

10
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:27,860
When we are short of supplies

11
00:00:28,060 --> 00:00:29,860
I hope you can borrow some food

12
00:00:30,460 --> 00:00:32,380
As long as you cooperate and obey

13
00:00:32,900 --> 00:00:35,380
I guarantee that everyone will be fine

14
00:00:35,740 --> 00:00:36,860
live in peace

15
00:00:38,260 --> 00:00:39,940
Typical Stockholm feud

16
00:00:40,380 --> 00:00:42,300
He made a slight pretense and found an excuse to clear his name.

17
00:00:42,540 --> 00:00:44,740
This group of people can easily let go of their hatred and be grateful

18
00:00:44,940 --> 00:00:46,220
It's so sad and ridiculous

19
00:00:46,660 --> 00:00:48,740
Chen Zhenghao knows how to manipulate people's hearts better than imagined

20
00:00:49,060 --> 00:00:51,020
He will threaten and comfort the residents at the same time.
